# GraphQL registry

Register extensions, union members, DataLoaders and the gateway’s existing error filter in its schema configuration. Substitute the types below with the feature’s schema types.

```csharp
schema.AddTypeExtension<CatalogQueries>()
    .AddDataLoader<ItemByIdLoader>();
```
